0","VerseNumber":58,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قُلۡ بِفَضۡلِ ٱللَّهِ وَبِرَحۡمَتِهِۦ فَبِذَٰلِكَ فَلۡيَفۡرَحُواْ هُوَ خَيۡرٞ مِّمَّا يَجۡمَعُونَ","TajweedText":"قُلْ بِفَضْلِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهِ وَبِرَحْمَتِه<tajweed class=madda_normal>ِۦ</tajweed> فَبِذ<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>لِكَ فَلْيَفْرَحُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> هُوَ خَيْ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>رٌ م</tajweed>ِّ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َا يَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>مَع<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٨</span>","End":"٥٨","PageNumber":215,"JuzNumber":11,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":177,"MaqraNumber":86,"HizbNumber":22,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":10,"SurahIndex":"010","VerseNumber":59,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قُلۡ أَرَءَيۡتُم مَّآ أَنزَلَ ٱللَّهُ لَكُم مِّن رِّزۡقٖ فَجَعَلۡتُم مِّنۡهُ حَرَامٗا وَحَلَٰلٗا قُلۡ ءَآللَّهُ أَذِنَ لَكُمۡۖ أَمۡ عَلَى ٱللَّهِ تَفۡتَرُونَ","TajweedText":"قُلْ أَرَءَيْت<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ّ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نز</tajweed>َلَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهُ لَك<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ّ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ِن ر</tajweed>ِّزْ<tajweed class=ikhafa>قٍ ف</tajweed>َجَعَلْت<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ِّنْهُ حَرَا<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>مًا و</tajweed>َحَلَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>ل<tajweed class=ikhafa>اً ق</tajweed>ُلْ ءَآللَّهُ أَذِنَ لَكُمْ‌ۖ أَمْ عَلَى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهِ تَفْتَر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٩</span>","End":"٥٩","PageNumber":215,"JuzNumber":11,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":177,"MaqraNumber":86,"HizbNumber":22,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":10,"SurahIndex":"010","VerseNumber":60,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَمَا ظَنُّ ٱلَّذِينَ يَفۡتَرُونَ عَلَى